
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#171714">
<meta name="description" content="CATACOMBS — Independent music, culture, community and gatherings. Discover events, artists and new creative movements.">
<title>CATACOMBS — Music, Culture & Community</title>

<!-- Typography -->
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --black: #171714;
  --cream: #f0eee6;
  --paper: #e6e2d7;
  --red: #bd432e;
  --orange: #df794c;
  --olive: #85866a;
  --grey: #77766e;
  --line: rgba(23,23,20,.2);
  --display: Impact, "Arial Narrow", sans-serif;
  --heading: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  --body: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  --mono: "DM Mono", monospace;
  --serif: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--black);
  font-family: var(--body);
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

button, input, textarea, select {
  font: inherit;
}

button { cursor: pointer; }

a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: block;
  object-fit: cover;
}

::selection {
  background: var(--red);
  color: white;
}

/* NAVIGATION */

.nav {
  height: 76px;
  padding: 0 5%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  background: var(--black);
  color: var(--cream);
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
}

.logo {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 35px;
  letter-spacing: -1px;
  line-height: 1;
}

.logo span { color: var(--red); }

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 32px;
}

.nav-links a {
  font-size: 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  font-weight: 700;
  transition: color .2s;
}

.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--orange); }

.nav-ticket {
  background: var(--red);
  color: white;
  padding: 13px 20px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  border: none;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.menu-toggle {
  display: none;
  background: none;
  color: white;
  border: 0;
  font-size: 25px;
}

/* GENERAL */

section {
  padding: 100px 7%;
}

.eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  color: var(--red);
}

.section-heading {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(45px, 7vw, 95px);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  line-height: .88;
  letter-spacing: -2px;
}

.section-intro {
  max-width: 470px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--grey);
  font-size: 14px;
  margin-top: 22px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 16px 25px;
  background: var(--red);
  color: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--red);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  font-weight: 800;
  transition: .25s;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.btn:hover {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--red);
}

.btn-dark {
  background: var(--black);
  border-color: var(--black);
}

.btn-dark:hover {
  color: var(--black);
}

.btn-outline {
  background: transparent;
  border-color: var(--black);
  color: var(--black);
}

.btn-outline:hover {
  background: var(--black);
  color: var(--cream);
}

/* HERO */

.hero {
  min-height: 680px;
  height: calc(100vh - 76px);
  max-height: 900px;
  background: var(--black);
  color: var(--cream);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 5% 7%;
}

.hero-image {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  opacity: .43;
  background:
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(23,23,20,.96) 0%, rgba(23,23,20,.55) 65%, rgba(23,23,20,.3)),
    url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501386761578-eac5c94b800a?w=2000") center/cover;
  filter: saturate(.65);
}

.hero-content {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  max-width: 850px;
}

.hero-kicker {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  color: var(--orange);
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-size: 11px;
  margin-bottom: 35px;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(90px, 16vw, 220px);
  line-height: .72;
  letter-spacing: -5px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.hero h1 span {
  display: block;
  color: var(--red);
  margin-left: 12%;
}

.hero-description {
  max-width: 410px;
  color: #c3c0b5;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 40px 0 28px;
}

.hero-actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
}

.hero .btn-outline {
  color: var(--cream);
  border-color: var(--cream);
}

.hero .btn-outline:hover {
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--black);
}

.hero-side {
  position: absolute;
  right: 7%;
  bottom: 45px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  writing-mode: vertical-rl;
  color: #c3c0b5;
}

/* INTRO STRIP */

.marquee {
  background: var(--red);
  color: white;
  padding: 17px 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  white-space: nowrap;
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 25px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.marquee-inner {
  display: inline-block;
  animation: scroll 30s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes scroll {
  from { transform: translateX(0); }
  to { transform: translateX(-50%); }
}

/* INTRO */

.intro {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 9%;
  align-items: center;
}

.intro h2 {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-size: clamp(35px, 5vw, 66px);
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.12;
}

.intro h2 em {
  color: var(--red);
}

.intro-text {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.9;
  color: var(--grey);
}

.intro-text p { margin-bottom: 20px; }

/* EVENTS */

.events {
  background: var(--paper);
}

.section-top {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: end;
  gap: 30px;
  margin-bottom: 55px;
}

.event-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 22px;
}

.event-card {
  background: var(--cream);
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: transform .3s;
}

.event-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); }

.event-image {
  height: 290px;
  position: relative;
  background: var(--black);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.event-image img {
  transition: transform .5s;
}

.event-card:hover .event-image img {
  transform: scale(1.05);
}

.event-date {
  position: absolute;
  top: 15px;
  left: 15px;
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 11px 13px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.event-info { padding: 23px; }

.event-category {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  color: var(--red);
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.event-info h3 {
  font-family: var(--heading);
  font-size: 25px;
  margin: 12px 0;
  letter-spacing: -1px;
}

.event-info p {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--grey);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.event-bottom {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  margin-top: 22px;
  padding-top: 18px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.event-price {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 12px;
}

.text-link {
  border: none;
  background: none;
  color: var(--red);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* EVENT ARCHIVE */

.archive {
  background: var(--cream);
}

.archive-controls {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 35px;
}

.archive-controls input,
.archive-controls select {
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 13px 16px;
  background: transparent;
  min-width: 180px;
  color: var(--black);
}

.archive-list {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.archive-row {
  padding: 23px 5px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr 130px 120px;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.archive-row .date {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--red);
}

.archive-row h3 { font-size: 20px; }

.archive-row .type {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--grey);
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.archive-row button {
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  color: var(--red);
  text-align: right;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
}

/* FRIENDS */

.friends {
  background: var(--black);
  color: var(--cream);
}

.friends .section-intro { color: #aaa79d; }

.friends-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 60px;
  align-items: center;
  margin-top: 65px;
}

.friends-image {
  height: 510px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.friends-image img { filter: saturate(.65); }

.artist-list { border-top: 1px solid #45443e; }

.artist {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 23px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #45443e;
}

.artist h3 {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-size: 28px;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.artist span {
  color: var(--orange);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.friends .btn-outline {
  color: var(--cream);
  border-color: var(--cream);
  margin-top: 35px;
}

.friends .btn-outline:hover {
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--black);
}

/* MAGAZINE */

.magazine {
  background: #dcd5c7;
}

.magazine-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 50px;
}

.article-image { height: 290px; overflow: hidden; }

.article-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-size: 26px;
  font-weight: 400;
  margin: 17px 0 10px;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.article-card p {
  color: var(--grey);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.article-meta {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  color: var(--red);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-top: 16px;
}

/* COMMUNITY */

.community {
  background: var(--red);
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 115px 7%;
}

.community .eyebrow { color: #f0c3ae; }

.community h2 {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(55px, 10vw, 120px);
  line-height: .9;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.community p {
  max-width: 470px;
  margin: 0 auto 30px;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: #f3d7cc;
}

.community .btn {
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--black);
  border-color: var(--cream);
}

.community .btn:hover {
  background: transparent;
  color: white;
  border-color: white;
}

/* PARTNERS */

.partners {
  background: var(--cream);
  text-align: center;
}

.partner-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 15px;
  margin-top: 45px;
  text-align: left;
}

.partner-card {
  padding: 32px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.partner-card h3 {
  font-size: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 13px;
}

.partner-card p {
  color: var(--grey);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}

/* FOOTER */

footer {
  background: var(--black);
  color: var(--cream);
  padding: 75px 7% 30px;
}

.footer-main {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 50px;
  padding-bottom: 60px;
}

.footer-logo {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 70px;
}

.footer-main p {
  color: #aaa79d;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  max-width: 300px;
  margin-top: 15px;
}

.footer-links h4 {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--orange);
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.footer-links a {
  display: block;
  font-size: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
  color: #c5c2b8;
}

.footer-bottom {
  border-top: 1px solid #45443e;
  padding-top: 22px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  color: #aaa79d;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  gap: 15px;
}

/* MODAL */

.modal {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 500;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,.8);
  display: none;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 20px;
}

.modal.active { display: flex; }

.modal-box {
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 35px;
  max-width: 470px;
  width: 100%;
  position: relative;
  max-height: 90vh;
  overflow-y: auto;
}

.modal-close {
  position: absolute;
  top: 15px;
  right: 20px;
  background: none;
  border: none;
  font-size: 26px;
}

.modal-box h2 {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 45px;
  margin: 15px 0;
}

.modal-box p {
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--grey);
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.modal-box label {
  font-size: 10px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  display: block;
  margin: 16px 0 8px;
}

.modal-box input,
.modal-box textarea,
.modal-box select {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 14px;
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  margin-bottom: 5px;
  color: var(--black);
}

.modal-box .btn { width: 100%; margin-top: 20px; }

.ticket-total {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 17px 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 13px;
  margin-top: 20px;
}

.quantity {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-top: 20px;
}

.quantity button {
  border: 1px solid var(--black);
  background: transparent;
  padding: 8px 15px;
}

.quantity span { font-family: var(--mono); }

/* COOKIE */

.cookie-banner {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 20px;
  left: 20px;
  right: 20px;
  max-width: 650px;
  z-index: 600;
  padding: 22px;
  background: var(--black);
  color: white;
  display: none;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 35px #0003;
}

.cookie-banner p {
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #ccc;
}

.cookie-banner button {
  border: 0;
  background: var(--red);
  color: white;
  padding: 12px 17px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* FORM MESSAGE */

.form-message {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  margin-top: 15px;
  color: var(--red);
}

/* RESPONSIVE */

@media(max-width:900px) {
  .event-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
  .magazine-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
  .intro { gap: 35px; }
  .nav-links { gap: 15px; }
}

@media(max-width:650px) {
  .nav { height: 65px; }
  .logo { font-size: 30px; }
  .menu-toggle { display: block; }
  .nav-links {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    top: 65px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    background: var(--black);
    padding: 25px 7% 35px;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 25px;
  }
  .nav-links.open { display: flex; }
  .nav-ticket { display: none; }
  .hero { min-height: 650px; height: 85vh; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(85px, 19vw, 130px); }
  .hero-side { display: none; }
  section { padding: 75px 6%; }
  .intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .section-top { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
  .event-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .event-image { height: 320px; }
  .archive-row {
    grid-template-columns: 85px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .archive-row .type { display: none; }
  .archive-row button { text-align: left; grid-column: 2; }
  .friends-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 35px; }
  .friends-image { height: 350px; }
  .magazine-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .article-image { height: 280px; }
  .partner-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .footer-main { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 35px; }
  .footer-main > div:first-child { grid-column: 1/-1; }
  .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; }
  .cookie-banner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  .cookie-banner button { width: 100%; }
}

/* ACCESSIBILITY */
:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--orange);
  outline-offset: 4px;
}

@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    animation-duration: .01ms !important;
    transition-duration: .01ms !important;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- NAVIGATION -->
<nav class="nav">
  <a class="logo" href="#home">CATA<span>COMBS</span></a>

  <button class="menu-toggle" onclick="toggleMenu()" aria-label="Toggle navigation">☰</button>

  <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
    <a href="#home" onclick="closeMenu()">Home</a>
    <a href="#events" onclick="closeMenu()">Events</a>
    <a href="#archive" onclick="closeMenu()">Archive</a>
    <a href="#friends" onclick="closeMenu()">Friends</a>
    <a href="#magazine" onclick="closeMenu()">Magazine</a>
    <a href="#contact" onclick="closeMenu()">Contact</a>
  </div>

  <a href="#events" class="nav-ticket">Get Tickets ↗</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<header class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-image"></div>

  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-kicker">INDEPENDENT CULTURE · EST. 2025</div>

    <h1>
      BELOW<br>
      <span>THE</span>
      SURFACE
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-description">
      An independent space for music, culture and creative expression.
      Bringing people together through sound, art and shared experiences.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#events" class="btn">Join the next gathering ↗</a>
      <a href="#friends" class="btn btn-outline">Explore Catacombs</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-side">INDEPENDENT MUSIC & CULTURE — DUBLIN</div>
</header>

<div class="marquee">
  <div class="marquee-inner">
    MUSIC · CULTURE · COMMUNITY · EXPRESSION · CONNECTION · MUSIC · CULTURE · COMMUNITY · EXPRESSION · CONNECTION ·
    MUSIC · CULTURE · COMMUNITY · EXPRESSION · CONNECTION ·
  </div>
</div>

<!-- INTRODUCTION -->
<section class="intro">
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow">01 / WHO WE ARE</div>
    <h2>
      Not just another night out.
      <em>Something to belong to.</em>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="intro-text">
    <p>
      CATACOMBS is an independent music and cultural platform.
      We create spaces where emerging sounds, creative people
      and new ideas come together.
    </p>
    <p>
      Rooted in underground culture, driven by curiosity and
      built around community. We believe the best experiences
      happen when people connect.
    </p>
    <a href="#friends" class="btn btn-dark">Discover our world ↗</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- UPCOMING EVENTS -->
<section class="events" id="events">
  <div class="section-top">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">02 / WHAT'S HAPPENING</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Upcoming<br>Gatherings.</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Different sounds. Different spaces. One shared feeling.
        Find your next gathering.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a href="#archive" class="btn btn-outline">All events ↗</a>
  </div>

  <div class="event-grid" id="featuredEvents"></div>
</section>

<!-- ARCHIVE -->
<section class="archive" id="archive">
  <div class="section-top">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">03 / THE ARCHIVE</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Past &<br>Present.</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        A living archive of the people, places and nights
        that make up the CATACOMBS story.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="archive-controls">
    <input type="search" id="eventSearch" placeholder="Search events..." oninput="filterEvents()">

    <select id="eventFilter" onchange="filterEvents()">
      <option value="all">All events</option>
      <option value="upcoming">Upcoming</option>
      <option value="past">Past events</option>
    </select>
  </div>

  <div class="archive-list" id="archiveList"></div>
</section>

<!-- CATACOMBS & FRIENDS -->
<section class="friends" id="friends">
  <div class="eyebrow">04 / CATACOMBS & FRIENDS</div>
  <h2 class="section-heading">People make<br>the culture.</h2>

  <p class="section-intro">
    Artists, selectors, creatives and collaborators.
    A growing network of people shaping the sound and identity
    of CATACOMBS.
  </p>

  <div class="friends-layout">
    <div class="friends-image">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516280440614-37939bbacd81?w=1000"
           alt="Artist performing live">
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">THE COMMUNITY / RESIDENTS</div>

      <div class="artist-list">
        <div class="artist">
          <h3>Artist One</h3>
          <span>Electronic</span>
        </div>
        <div class="artist">
          <h3>Artist Two</h3>
          <span>DJ / Selector</span>
        </div>
        <div class="artist">
          <h3>Artist Three</h3>
          <span>Experimental</span>
        </div>
        <div class="artist">
          <h3>Artist Four</h3>
          <span>Visual Artist</span>
        </div>
        <div class="artist">
          <h3>Artist Five</h3>
          <span>Producer</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">
        Become a resident artist ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MAGAZINE -->
<section class="magazine" id="magazine">
  <div class="section-top">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">05 / THE JOURNAL</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Beyond<br>the music.</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Interviews, creative perspectives, photography and
        stories from the underground.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">Submit a story ↗</a>
  </div>

  <div class="magazine-grid">
    <article class="article-card">
      <div class="article-image">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516450360452-9312f5e86fc7?w=900"
             alt="Live music and crowd">
      </div>
      <div class="article-meta">01 / CULTURE · 6 MIN READ</div>
      <h3>Finding identity in the underground.</h3>
      <p>Exploring the spaces and communities redefining independent music.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="article-card">
      <div class="article-image">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492684223066-81342ee5ff30?w=900"
             alt="Concert atmosphere">
      </div>
      <div class="article-meta">02 / PEOPLE · 4 MIN READ</div>
      <h3>The people behind the sound.</h3>
      <p>Conversations with the artists shaping a new creative generation.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="article-card">
      <div class="article-image">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514525253161-7a46d19cd819?w=900"
             alt="Music performance">
      </div>
      <div class="article-meta">03 / MUSIC · 8 MIN READ</div>
      <h3>Why independent spaces matter.</h3>
      <p>On the importance of preserving spaces for experimentation.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- COMMUNITY CTA -->
<section class="community">
  <div class="eyebrow">06 / BECOME PART OF IT</div>
  <h2>FIND YOUR<br>PEOPLE.</h2>
  <p>
    Stay close to what's happening. New gatherings, artists,
    music and stories. No noise, just the things worth knowing.
  </p>

  <button class="btn" onclick="openModal('newsletterModal')">
    Join the CATACOMBS community ↗
  </button>
</section>

<!-- PARTNERS -->
<section class="partners" id="contact">
  <div class="eyebrow">07 / WORK WITH US</div>
  <h2 class="section-heading">Let's create<br>something.</h2>
  <p class="section-intro" style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">
    We collaborate with spaces, brands and people who believe
    in independent music and creative culture.
  </p>

  <div class="partner-grid">
    <div class="partner-card">
      <div class="eyebrow">01 / VENUES</div>
      <h3>Venue partnerships.</h3>
      <p>Have a space that could become something special?
        Let's explore a collaboration.</p>
      <button class="text-link" onclick="openContact('Venue partnership')">
        Work with us ↗
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="partner-card">
      <div class="eyebrow">02 / BRANDS</div>
      <h3>Become a partner.</h3>
